     3,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Dear colleagues,</div><div><br></div><div>I&#39;m dealing with symmetric and asymmetric shape components of rodent skulls. I use bilat.symmetry() to get corresponding components and to perform two-way Procrustes ANOVA to test directional and fluctuating asymmetry for significance. Significance of interaction between side and individual is very important to me because comparison of fluctuating asymmetry between groups is one of my goals.</div><div>When using geomorph 3.0.7 (under R 3.4.4) I got the following result:</div><div><br></div><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span> library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span>geomorph</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span> load</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;ondatra.rda&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># GPA for bilateral object</span><span><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span> skull</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span>sym </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span> bilat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span>symmetry</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span>A </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span> dat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">object</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span>sym </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span> T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span> land</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span>pairs </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span> pairs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span> <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span>                             ind </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span> meta$id</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span> replicate </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span> meta$measurement</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span> <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span>                             iter </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">999</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Initial</span><span> GPA<br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">|===========================================================================================|</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">%</span><span><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Object</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Symmetry</span><span> GPA<br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">|===========================================================================================|</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">%</span><span><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Shape</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Analysis</span><span><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sums</span><span> of </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Squares</span><span> calculations</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1000</span><span> permutations</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">|===========================================================================================|</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">%</span><span><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span> summary</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span>skull</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span>sym</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Call</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span><br>bilat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span>symmetry</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span>A </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span> dat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span> ind </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span> meta$id</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span> replicate </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span> meta$measurement</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span>      </span><span style=\"color:#008\">object</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span>sym </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span> T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span> land</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span>pairs </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span> pairs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span> iter </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">999</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span> <br><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Symmetry</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span>data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span> type</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Object</span><span> <br><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Type</span><span> I </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sequential</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sums</span><span> of </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Squares</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">and</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Cross</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span>products<br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Randomized</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Residual</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Permutation</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Procedure</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Used</span><span><br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">1000</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Permutations</span><span><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Shape</span><span> ANOVA<br>                    </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Df</span><span>       SS        MS     </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Rsq</span><span>      F       Z </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Pr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(&gt;</span><span>F</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span>   <br>ind                 </span><span style=\"color:#066\">35</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.208633</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.0059609</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.67910</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">6.8903</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">13.4140</span><span>  </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.001</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">**</span><span><br>side                 </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.002879</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.0028794</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.00937</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3.3283</span><span>  </span><span style=\"color:#066\">4.8284</span><span>  </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.001</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">**</span><span><br>ind</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span>side            </span><span style=\"color:#066\">35</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.030279</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.0008651</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.09856</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.9520</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">19.7287</span><span>  </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.001</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">**</span><span><br>ind</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span>side</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span>replicate  </span><span style=\"color:#066\">72</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.065427</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.0009087</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.21296</span><span>                         <br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Total</span><span>              </span><span style=\"color:#066\">143</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.307218</span><span>                                           <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">---</span><span><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Signif</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span> codes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span>  </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">‘***’</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.001</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">‘**’</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.01</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">‘*’</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.05</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">‘.’</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.1</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">‘</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">’</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span></div></code></div><div dir=\"ltr\"></div></div></div></div></div><div><br></div><div>Interaction is significant.</div><div><br></div><div>But after updating to version 3.1.1 (under R 3.5.3) key result become insignificant:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span> summary</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span>skull</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span>sym</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span> <br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Call</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span> bilat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span>symmetry</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span>A </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span> dat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span> ind </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span> meta$id</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span> replicate </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span> meta$measurement</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">object</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span>sym </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span> T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span> land</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span>pairs </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span> pairs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span> iter </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">999</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span> <br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Symmetry</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span>data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span> type</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Object</span><span> <br><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Type</span><span> I </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sequential</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Sums</span><span> of </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Squares</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">and</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Cross</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span>products <br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Randomized</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Residual</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Permutation</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Procedure</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Used</span><span> <br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">1000</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Permutations</span><span> <br><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Shape</span><span> ANOVA <br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">D</span><span style=\"color:#606\">f</span><span> SS MS </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Rsq</span><span> F Z </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Pr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(&gt;</span><span>F</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span> <br>ind </span><span style=\"color:#066\">35</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.208633</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.0059609</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.67910</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">6.8903</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">13.4140</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.001</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">**</span><span> <br>side </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.002879</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.0028794</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.00937</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3.3283</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">4.8284</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.001</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">**</span><span> <br>ind</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span>side </span><span style=\"color:#066\">35</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.030279</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.0008651</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.09856</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.9520</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">19.7287</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.830</span><span> <br>ind</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span>side</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span>replicate </span><span style=\"color:#066\">72</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.065427</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.0009087</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.21296</span><span> <br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Total</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">143</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.307218</span><span> <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">---</span><span> <br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Signif</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span> codes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">‘***’</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.001</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">‘**’</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.01</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">‘*’</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.05</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">‘.’</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.1</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">‘</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">’</span><span> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span> <br></span></div></code></div></div><div><br></div><div>What version gives the &quot;proper&quot; result?</div><div><br></div><div>I attach my data and my test script..</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div></div></blockquote></div></div></div>"
