     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;geomorph R package&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geomorph-r-pack...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo post to this group, send email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geomorph-...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nVisit this group at <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/group/geomorph-r-package\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/group/geomorph-r-package&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484976980000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3uFk5Mt462kLQVsWUpND_s\">https://groups.google.com/group/geomorph-r-package</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/geomorph-r-package/6637b422-c5b0-4709-b2b6-9ac0a5bb043a%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/geomorph-r-package/6637b422-c5b0-4709-b2b6-9ac0a5bb043a%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484976980000&amp;usg=AOvVaw24F6OEbudh6JhngD3wY93n\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/geomorph-r-package/6637b422-c5b0-4709-b2b6-9ac0a5bb043a%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484976980000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3_8F-Ny-d6drQkaBLEEjqZ\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n<span>&lt;ondatra.rda&gt;</span><span>&lt;bs-test.r&gt;</span></div></blockquote></div